function renderChangelogMarkdown(markdown){
 const root=$('changelogContent');if(!root)return;root.replaceChildren();let currentList=null,seenRootTitle=false;
 const lines=String(markdown||'').split(/\r?\n/);
 for(const rawLine of lines){
  const trimmed=rawLine.trim();
  if(!trimmed){currentList=null;const spacer=document.createElement('div');spacer.className='changelog-markdown-space';spacer.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');root.appendChild(spacer);continue}
  if(/^#{1,3}\s/.test(trimmed)){
   currentList=null;const level=trimmed.match(/^#+/)[0].length,title=trimmed.slice(level).trim();
   if(level===1&&title.toLowerCase()==='changelog'&&!seenRootTitle){seenRootTitle=true;continue}
   const heading=document.createElement('h'+(level+1));heading.className='changelog-markdown-heading changelog-markdown-heading-'+level;appendChangelogInline(heading,title);root.appendChild(heading);continue;
  }
  const bullet=trimmed.match(/^[-*]\s+(.*)$/);
  if(bullet){
   if(!currentList){currentList=document.createElement('ul');currentList.className='changelog-markdown-list';root.appendChild(currentList)}
   const item=document.createElement('li');appendChangelogInline(item,bullet[1]);currentList.appendChild(item);continue;
  }
  currentList=null;const paragraph=document.createElement('p');paragraph.className='changelog-markdown-paragraph';appendChangelogInline(paragraph,trimmed);root.appendChild(paragraph);
 }
}
